% expect-output: /undefinedresult
% expect-output: 3.0
% Scenario: an error in the form procedure propagates as that error and
% leaves the graphics state as it was before execform.
3 setlinewidth
{ << /FormType 1 /BBox [0 0 10 10] /Matrix [1 0 0 1 0 0]
  /PaintProc { pop 9 setlinewidth 1 0 div } >> execform } stopped pop
$error /errorname get ==
currentlinewidth =
